=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=647970c48ae569ff4490cc7afc035528 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ねね子さん、初めまして\n\nVtuberの緋乃ゆにさんを描いていただけないでしょうか。\nポーズや背景はおまかせいたします\nサムネでも使えるように透過を\nよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://x.com/HinoYuni\n固定コメントに３面図がございます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NeNe_Stamp/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea81d31f/uploads/origins/3bb63f63-e7f1-431f-9d4d-51050a202413?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0431cf3eaed1dc1424c4252db86716f6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea81d31f/uploads/origins/3bb63f63-e7f1-431f-9d4d-51050a202413?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0431cf3eaed1dc1424c4252db86716f6, https://si.imgix.net/ea81d31f/uploads/origins/3bb63f63-e7f1-431f-9d4d-51050a202413?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92b7a33d615d7ec482303037955eb605 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea81d31f/uploads/origins/3bb63f63-e7f1-431f-9d4d-51050a202413?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be884cbb3316ffe09d264f8e8eef070f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "SBI e-sports所属の春水レイさんを描いて頂きたいです。\n構図・ポーズ等はお任せで、衣装は新しいほうの上着オフverでお願いしたいです。\n（参考URL：https://twitter.com/ShunsuiRei_SBI/status/1678330648157892608）\nSNSのアイコン等に利用したいのと、背景に誕生日おめでとう～の旨の文字がある差分を頂けると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NeNe_Stamp/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c613ee7/uploads/origins/367f4955-83ea-462f-b8f4-dd54869e648f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f074190817253c8369b1262c3415e9e8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c613ee7/uploads/origins/367f4955-83ea-462f-b8f4-dd54869e648f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f074190817253c8369b1262c3415e9e8, https://si.imgix.net/7c613ee7/uploads/origins/367f4955-83ea-462f-b8f4-dd54869e648f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8259971ae372aa82dff26b1fe5d509c1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c613ee7/uploads/origins/367f4955-83ea-462f-b8f4-dd54869e648f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1b108e6953996424a00b648234ad68e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! How have you been? It's been a while since we last worked together. ^^\n\nI really loved the last illustrations you've delivered to me so I was hoping to request another illustration!\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my Vtuber for the sake of using the illustration for merchandise. The merchandise will be an acrylic key holder. I would like to be able to have it so the key holder can be two-sided rather than just having a design on one side, if possible!\n\nIf possible, something similar to the \"feeling\" of these past illustrations would be nice!\nhttps://twitter.com/NeNe_Stamp/status/1746164259715948839/photo/4\nhttps://twitter.com/NeNe_Stamp/status/1749020434379735504\n\nInformation about my Character that may help:\nHe is an energetic Vtuber who is always doing his best to bring joy to his fans by any means possible! He often does ASMR streams, is always working on projects to bring smiles to his fans in new and exciting ways and can fluctuate between being kind-hearted and being childish, smug and bratty.\n\nIf it would help to have Taiyou hold something in his pose, then maybe something like one of these ideas may help!\n* A cup of bubble tea\n* A plushy of a mouse with a pink bow on its head in reference to his Vtuber partner: https://twitter.com/_lulufleur/status/1755241133477638482/photo/1\n* A Nintendo Switch/GameBoy Color/GameBoy Advance\n* A disposable film camera or professional grade camera\n* A mechanical keyboard with pastel colors\n\nI leave the final decision on pose, expression, etc up to you!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/_tai__you_/status/1631715542770884624/photo/1", 